# gcloud upload rules for the orbitjump App Engine service.
#
# IMPORTANT: Do NOT add "#!include:.gitignore" here. The repo .gitignore ignores
# deploy/orbitjump/public/ (that folder is generated from game/ at deploy time),
# so inheriting it makes gcloud skip the ENTIRE game payload — it uploads only the
# Go files and deploys an empty/broken service (symptom: "Uploading 3 files" and
# the live site serving stale content). We must upload public/, so keep this file
# minimal: ignore only VCS/build cruft, never the static payload.
.gcloudignore
.git
.gitignore
orbitjump
*.exe
